///  * [MaterialApp], which inserts an [Overlay] widget indirectly via its [Navigator].
///  * [CupertinoApp], which inserts an [Overlay] widget indirectly via its [Navigator].
///  * [Stack], which allows directly displaying a stack of widgets.␀␀À␀dµÀ␀d¶À␀d§À␀d´À␀d¨À␀dœÀ␀dƒ4À␀dœ␀␀␀␀␀À␀d¼À␀d½À␀dÉÀ␀dÊÀ␀d¼À␀d¼lÀ␀dÚ␀␀␀␀À␀e@À␀e@À␀eN␀␀␀À␀eUÀ␀eUÀ␀ec␀␀À␀e,À␀e,À␀e0␀␀␀␀À␀fcÀ␀fcÀ␀fp␀␀À␀fIÀ␀fIˆôÀ␀fN␀␀␀␀À␀pÀ␀pÀ␀p␀␀␀À␀p–À␀p–À␀p¤␀␀␀À␀p«À␀p«À␀p¹␀␀À␀oAÀ␀oA‚VÀ␀pz%/// Insert the given entry into the overlay.
